{"id":"n16483-2-5","stage":2,"title":"쌍둥이 · 双子(大厦)","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16483-2-5-1","ko":"나 오늘 시내에 나가서 쌍둥이 목걸이를 샀어.","zh":"今天去市区买了一对一样的项链。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"시내에","meaning":"市内，市里","explanation":"시내：市内，市里；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시내","audio":"/audio/47aebe2586c6cf8d52e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65118","senseId":"1","lemma":"시내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시내에","audio":"/audio/1722d9e9c6cc0615ed55.mp3"}},{"text":"나가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가서","audio":"/audio/585705317584c3255a86.mp3"}},{"text":"쌍둥이","meaning":"一模一样、成对的（项链）","explanation":"쌍둥이 的比喻义指长得一样的一对东西；此处是一对一样的项链，不指两个人或大厦。","readings":[{"term":"쌍둥이","audio":"/audio/c06be6d46636dc658e73.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16483","senseId":"2","lemma":"쌍둥이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쌍둥이","audio":"/audio/c06be6d46636dc658e73.mp3"}},{"text":"목걸이를","meaning":"项链","explanation":"목걸이：项链；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"목걸이","audio":"/audio/1b565ae8e86d1ff1a554.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16150","senseId":"1","lemma":"목걸이