":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}},{"text":"친구랑","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구랑","audio":"/audio/74f6c9e10aa7a90f70e1.mp3"}},{"text":"하나씩","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一；씩：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나씩","audio":"/audio/3104aa4b25e408324861.mp3"}},{"text":"나누어","meaning":"分配，分","explanation":"나누다：分配，分；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"4","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나누어","audio":"/audio/eda1720aecb6604f7f22.mp3"}},{"text":"가지려고","meaning":"拥有，得到","explanation":"가지다：拥有，得到；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"2","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지려고","audio":"/audio/b1cd7a5cb3305e0dcf25.mp3"}},{"text":"샀구나?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀구나","audio":"/audio/18664ccc199ebb745314.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term"